# AWS Artifact User Guide

> Download compliance-related information using AWS Artifact.

- [What is AWS Artifact?](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/artifact/latest/ug/what-is-aws-artifact.md)
- [Getting started](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/artifact/latest/ug/getting-started.md)
- [Downloading reports](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/artifact/latest/ug/downloading-documents.md)
- [CloudTrail logging](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/artifact/latest/ug/cloudtrail-logging.md)
- [Document history](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/artifact/latest/ug/doc-history.md)

## [Managing agreements](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/artifact/latest/ug/managing-agreements.md)

- [Accepting account agreements](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/artifact/latest/ug/accept-single-agreement.md): Learn how to use AWS Artifact to accept agreements for a single AWS account.
- [Terminating account agreements](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/artifact/latest/ug/terminate-single-agreement.md): Learn how to use AWS Artifact to terminate agreements for a single AWS account.
- [Accepting organization agreements](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/artifact/latest/ug/accept-org-agreement.md): Learn how to use AWS Artifact to accept agreements for multiple AWS accounts in an organization in AWS Organizations.
- [Terminating organization agreements](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/artifact/latest/ug/terminate-org-agreement.md): Learn how to use AWS Artifact to terminate agreements for multiple AWS accounts in an organization in AWS Organizations.
- [Offline agreements](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/artifact/latest/ug/manage-offline-agreement.md): If you have an existing offline agreement, AWS Artifact displays the agreements that you accepted offline.


## [Assurance Assistant](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/artifact/latest/ug/managing-compliance-inquiries.md)

- [Setting up](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/artifact/latest/ug/assurance-assistant-setting-up.md): Learn how to configure IAM permissions and navigate to Assurance Assistant in AWS Artifact.
- [Submitting questions](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/artifact/latest/ug/assurance-assistant-submitting.md): Learn how to submit a single question or upload a questionnaire file using Assurance Assistant in AWS Artifact.
- [Reviewing and exporting responses](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/artifact/latest/ug/assurance-assistant-reviewing-exporting.md): Learn how to review AI-generated responses and export completed questionnaires from Assurance Assistant in AWS Artifact.
- [Best practices for effective questions](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/artifact/latest/ug/assurance-assistant-best-practices.md): Learn how to write effective questions, find additional resources, and review key terms for Assurance Assistant in AWS Artifact.
- [Glossary](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/artifact/latest/ug/assurance-assistant-glossary.md): Definitions of key terms used in Assurance Assistant documentation.


## [Configuring notifications](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/artifact/latest/ug/managing-notifications.md)

- [Creating a configuration](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/artifact/latest/ug/notifications-configuration-create.md): Learn how to create a configuration for AWS Artifact notification settings.
- [Editing a configuration](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/artifact/latest/ug/notifications-configuration-edit.md): Learn how to edit a configuration for AWS Artifact notification settings.
- [Deleting a configuration](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/artifact/latest/ug/notifications-configuration-delete.md): Learn how to delete a configuration for AWS Artifact notification settings.


## [Identity and access management](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/artifact/latest/ug/security-iam.md)

- [Granting user access](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/artifact/latest/ug/grant-access.md): Complete the following steps to grant users permissions to AWS Artifact based on the level of access they need.
- [Example IAM policies in commercial AWS Regions](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/artifact/latest/ug/example-iam-policies.md): You can create permissions policies that grant permissions to IAM users.
- [Example IAM policies in AWS GovCloud (US) Regions](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/artifact/latest/ug/example-govcloud-iam-policies.md): These policies are ONLY applicable in AWS GovCloud (US) Regions.
- [Using AWS managed policies](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/artifact/latest/ug/security-iam-awsmanpol.md): Learn about AWS managed policies for AWS Artifact and recent changes to those policies.
- [Using service-linked roles](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/artifact/latest/ug/using-service-linked-roles.md): How to use service-linked roles to give AWS Artifact access to resources in your AWS account.
- [Using IAM condition keys](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/artifact/latest/ug/using-condition-keys.md): You can use IAM condition keys to provide fine-grained access to reports on AWS Artifact, based on specific report categories and series.


